title: Gospel Blues in Six
key: Eb
tempo: 60
meter: 6/8
style: blues

// The blues counted in two, as a gospel blues ballad is: two slow beats to
// the bar, three eighths in each. Sixteen bars: the quick change; the four
// going minor, then the six, into the two; the two and the five said twice,
// the second time into a turnaround of a chord a beat.
[A]
| Eb7 | Ab7  | Eb7     | %       |
| Ab7 | Abm6 | Eb7     | C7      |
| Fm7 | Bb7  | Eb7     | C7      |
| Fm7 | Bb7  | Eb7 Ab7 | Eb7 Bb7 |
